From: napatc1 <napatchoomchaiyot@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:02:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Give players a reference code instead of asking for their
 Discord ID

- The report server saves each report under a random 6-character code
  (like 7k3qxf) and sends it back. The player gives it to staff, who run
  /ssresult refcode:7k3qxf user:@player in the PrimeTiers bot.
- ModAnzer.exe: the Discord ID box is gone. Get code sends the results and
  shows the code, and copies it.
- ModAnzer.ps1: Press Enter to send and get your code. -DiscordId is gone.

Catch cheats and PvP macros that are published on Modrinth:
- Recognised mods now count as [CHEAT] when their Modrinth slug or SHA1 is
  in flagged.txt, when their name says what they do (AutoTotem, Crystal
  Macro, TriggerBot...), or when their jar has a class named like a cheat
  module. flagged.txt can be edited on GitHub without a release.
